ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Eh, escucha! Ya que estás
aquí, ¿te apetece probar el
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Juego de la moneda{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Si ganas tú, ¡te venderé mi querid{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} a un
precio superasequible!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Si gano yo, el precio será cosa mía.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:000D:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
A ver, ¿qué me dices? ¿Te animas?{{TAG:0008:0005:0800150002002800}}
¡Me animo!
A lo mejor otro día

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehi, già che ci sei, ti va di giocare
con me al {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}gioco della moneta{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Se vinci tu, ti vendo {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0C0069006C0020006D0069006F000C006C00610020006D006900610002003000}} costos{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} a un prezzo
stracciato!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Se vinco io, invece, non puoi
rifiutarti di comprarl{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}, qualunque
sia il prezzo che stabilisco.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:000D:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Che mi dici? Vuoi giocare?{{TAG:0008:0005:0800150002002800}}
Accetto la sfida!
Un'altra volta.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ya like that? I'm good, huh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sorry to do this to ya, but you'll
have to give me {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0009:0300}} Bells{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Nasılmış? İyiyim, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bunu yapmak zorunda olduğum için üzgünüm
ama bana {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0004:0009:0300}} Çan{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} vermen gerekecek!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Right! Listen up!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} So this coin here,
you have to guess where it is, right
or left{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
As in which hand it's in.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} It's simple!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}It'll be completely secret, of course.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm pretty confident in my nimble
fingers! {{TAG:0009:0001:0A000B000C00}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}A ver, ¡atiende!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} ¿Ves la moneda?
Pues tienes que adivinar dónde está,
a la derecha o a la izquierda{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Es decir, en qué mano la tengo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
¡Está chupado!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Yo no te voy a dar ninguna pista.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Y ojo, que tengo unos dedos muy
ágiles!{{TAG:0009:0001:0A000B000C00}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}OK! Senti qua!{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Devi indovinare
dove nascondo questa moneta, se
nella mano destra o nella sinistra{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Insomma, devi dirmi in quale
delle due mani si trova.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Il meccanismo è semplice!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Io però cercherò di fare tutto con
la massima segretezza.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Confido
nella velocità delle mie dita!{{TAG:0009:0001:0A000B000C00}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tamam! İyi dinle!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Şu parayı hangi elimde
sakladığımı tahmin edeceksin: sağ mı
sol mu{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yani hangi elimde olduğunu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Basit!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Tabii tamamen gizli olacak.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Parmaklarımın hızına bayağı güveniyorum! {{TAG:0009:0001:0A000B000C00}}

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}İplik ve düğüm çözmede de iyiyim{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
En azından öyle sanıyorum.
Daha kimseyle yarışmadım!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Has acertado, no puede ser!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
A ver, entonces hemos quedado
dos a uno para ti.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}} ¡Jooo, he perdido!{{TAG:0009:0001:040004000500}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Was hab ich nur falsch gemacht?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wie konnt ich nur verlieren?
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci ! Surtout, te décourage pas.
On fait la revanche quand tu veux,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merci ! Et t'laisse pas abattre !
On remettra ça un d'ces jours,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
